From 7484b408e8efd163bf4a9453c8bab47574e255fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:02:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] http: delegate /chronik/* and /chronik/ws on main RPC port to
 Chronik server

With -chronik, the RPC port now also serves Chronik under /chronik
(-chronikpubliconrpcport, default 1), so a single port can carry JSON-RPC,
REST and Chronik over plain HTTP or TLS:

- HTTP requests to /chronik/<path> are forwarded asynchronously, on the
  I/O threads, to Chronik's own listener (the first -chronikbind address,
  via loopback for wildcard binds, default port BaseParams().ChronikPort()).
  Hop-by-hop headers are dropped, X-Forwarded-For/-Proto are added, a
  keep-alive upstream connection is reused per client connection, and the
  reply gets the usual zstd Content-Encoding when the client accepts it.
- WebSocket upgrades to /chronik/ws are accepted locally and bridged
  message-for-message (text/binary preserved) to Chronik's /ws.

RegisterPublicHTTPPrefix() exempts such paths from the -rpcallowip
address check; they perform no RPC authentication. JSON-RPC and
/wallet/ keep the ACL and Basic auth. Builds without Chronik, -chronik=0
or -chronikpubliconrpcport=0 return 404 for /chronik.

The new chronik_rpc_port_proxy.py test checks byte-identical replies
against the Chronik port, error passthrough, https, zstd, ws:// and wss://
subscriptions, and the opt-out.

Integration adaptation relative to HTTP/WS series-20261019/0002: attach public-prefix registration to the retained asynchronous handler registration API and retain HTTPCoroutinePool; proxy transport and ACL semantics are unchanged.

Coordinator integration provenance (reference405):
Preserve earlier purposeful source repairs through downstream consumer/context adaptations; exact conflict ledger retained.
All60 authored input payloads retained, with prerequisite-aware same-purpose splits; distinct legacy-index and inherited CXX compatibility remain independent. Pre-format source equals exact403+all60 control tree95718fceff83364b74294a751bd752b2f1a4e384. Only pinnedRuff import/format cleanup follows. Original author commands/hashes are historical reference evidence, not combined405 approval. Reference OFF/native/Rust full gates are preserved separately; combined compile/runtime NOT_RUN.
